            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit charged this phase, pick a visible enemy unit within 1&quot; of it to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a D3. Add 1 to the roll if the target is the enemy quarry. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.</characteristic>
